# Backend source — not needed for GitHub Pages (Apps Script code is pasted
# directly into the Apps Script editor, not deployed via this repo), and it
# contains a hardcoded bank account number/IFSC/UPI as a fallback default
# that has no business being in a public repo either way.
Gscript.txt

# Internal reference docs (architecture notes, a security audit that
# describes exploit techniques even for already-fixed issues, migration
# planning) — useful for continuing work in Claude Code, not for a public
# GitHub Pages repo.
HANDOFF.md
SECURITY_AUDIT.md
CLOUD_RUN_MIGRATION_PLAN.md

# The Cloud Run backend-in-progress — this git repo/remote (Justatest2) is
# the GitHub Pages FRONTEND repo specifically. The backend is a separate
# codebase that will eventually get its own repo (or its own deploy path
# straight to Cloud Run) and must never end up mixed into this one — it
# will contain a real .env with real secrets once deployment starts, and
# mixing it in here is exactly the kind of accident that already happened
# once this session with a web-upload that included files it shouldn't
# have. If backend/ ever needs its own git history, initialize that as its
# own repository rather than un-ignoring it here.
backend/
